// The rarest of the set, and the only affix worth four points across two
// stats — of Recursion, the clean ceiling, is worth three. What buys the
// fourth is the DECOMP, and no single stat passes +2, so the calibration
// ceiling stands.
//
// Its cost is the player's alone: a program never attempts a capture, so
// DECOMP does nothing on a companion (see of Quiet Handshakes). A copy of
// this handed across is a copy whose drawback is inert — which is the one
// piece of texture in the set that rewards owning two of something, and
// the reason it takes any slot rather than the Module a player keeps.
(
    id: "of_hot_swap",
    suffix: Some("of Hot Swap"),
    stats: (atk: 2, mitigation: 6, decompiler: -1),
    weight: 4,
)
